{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2810700/extras/76a4bf7f55e3e7c6366d1ad9633c8460.avif?t=1767391793\" width=800 height=358 /></span>An Indie Game Developed by a Single Person: Alessio Serenellini</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upcoming Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Octopus Goulash is preparing to enter <strong>Early Access</strong>, giving players the chance to explore a world in constant evolution. The initial release will be <strong>available only in English for Windows</strong>, with <strong>multi-language support and a Mac version coming next month.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2810700/extras/9fd673fd1d152a98dddfe49c8d345fb1.poster.avif?t=1767391793\" width=800 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2810700/extras/9fd673fd1d152a98dddfe49c8d345fb1.webm?t=1767391793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2810700/extras/9fd673fd1d152a98dddfe49c8d345fb1.mp4?t=1767391793\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a Dystopian Future:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture into an open-world set in a futuristic city, immersed in a dystopian atmosphere. Discover a intricate and lively ecosystem where NPC lives intertwine and influence your fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Live a Holistic Experience:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience unparalleled interaction with a complete urban ecosystem, where every action impacts the surrounding world. Witness NPC lives evolve in real-time, influenced by your choices and actions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2810700/extras/56298e3eb99cc9993f4defd746618036.avif?t=1767391793\" width=500 height=275 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft Your Story:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape your narrative in this futuristic cityscape, where your decisions determine the course of events. Confront the challenges of a constantly changing world, where every choice matters and every action has consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a Living City:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a vibrant metropolis, where every street holds secrets and every building tells a story. Explore a detailed open-world rich with hidden mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenge the Norms:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face the challenges of a dystopian future and discover new ways to survive in a hostile world. Break the rules, form alliances, and forge your destiny in this captivating and ever-evolving world.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2810700?t=1767391793","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2810700/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767391793","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2810700/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767391793","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2810700/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767391793","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragr